Third-party material
====================

The MIT License above applies only to the author's own work (program code,
helper scripts and own documents). The following third-party material is
NOT covered by it and remains under its own terms:

1. Postal code data (swisstopo)
   Files: data/raw/ortschaftenverzeichnis_plz_2056.csv.zip,
          data/raw/ortschaftenverzeichnis_plz_4326.csv.zip,
          data/sec-zip-list.csv (derived from the 2056 file)
   Source: Federal Office of Topography swisstopo, "Amtliches
           Ortschaftenverzeichnis mit Postleitzahl und Perimeter"
   Terms:  Open Government Data - free use, also commercial;
           source attribution required.
   Attribution: (c) swisstopo

2. Relay list SEC 2026
   Files: data/SEC2026_Relais-Liste.csv, data/SEC2026_Relais-Liste.md
   Source: relay list of the SEC logging app for the Swiss Emergency
           Contest (USKA), transcribed from a screen video.
   Terms:  Rights not yet clarified. Not licensed under MIT.

3. Reference documents
   Files: docs/reference/*
   Source: third parties (e.g. contest rules of the USKA).
   Terms:  Copyright of the respective owners. Not licensed under MIT.
